<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-6 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p>&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: bold;"> <span style="font-size: 16px;">材質的進化</span></span></p><p>&nbsp; 不銹鋼材質以外，還有鍍鈦處理，</p><p>&nbsp; 是以物理真空離子鍍膜方式將氮化鈦(Tin)加工在材質之上，</p><p>&nbsp; 具備更強的抗氧化、耐磨耗跟不退色的優點</p><p><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp; 功能介紹</span><br></p><p>&nbsp; 路亞環的開合，PE線剪，基本夾東西功能等等....一隻搞定</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p> <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp; 外觀設計</span></p><p>&nbsp; 俐落，符合人體工學的握把，讓手部手用酒後不會有疼痛感<br></p></div><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"></div><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"></div></div><div class="placeholder-content col-md-6 ui-droppable"><div class="current-upload-image"><a class="upload-image ui-draggable" href="#"><img width="100%" height="" class="img-responsive" alt="" src="/uploads/images/c963bb12b6040b3308c24d46076c1a81.jpg"></a></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><img style="width: 499.82px; height: 226.23px;" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-filename="WEFOX DFS0103A 不銹鋼路亞鉗3.jpg"></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div>